Because running VSLAM is fun (1.2) 📷🧭📍

Following up on the previous experiments, I ran our latest system, AllFeature-VSLAM, tightly coupling multiple feature types (ORB, SIFT and SuperPoint).

🎬 Video: https://lnkd.in/gtFMjWBn

This time using the #MADMAX dataset — a Mars-analog dataset acquired in the Moroccan desert using DLR’s portable SUPER sensor unit. It includes 36 navigation experiments across 8 diverse sites, with over 9.2 km of trajectories, covering challenging environmental conditions such as illumination changes, texture scarcity, and varying terrain.

The dataset provides synchronized multi-sensor data (stereo, mono, omnidirectional cameras + IMU) along with high-accuracy ground truth in position and orientation, obtained via RTK-GNSS fusion. 

The  experiments are fully reproducible using #VSLAMLAB with a single command:

pixi run demo allfeature-dev madmax A-0

We maintain #VSLAMLAB with 0 open pull requests, 0 open issues, and growing momentum — ⭐ 483 stars · 🍴 60 forks.

